ut members area to get their data and help make their decisions. You can sign up and get instant access to this elite Fantasy data here: https://bit.ly/FFScoutBlackBox\n----------------------------------------------\n👍 🖋️ Don't forget to Like this video and Subscribe to FPL Blackbox… https://bit.ly/3jwrN96\n\n⬛ … and join the FPL BlackBox league!\nCode: m6h64h\n----------------------------------------------\n🎫 Become a Channel Member and/or become a Godfather Tier member on Patreon!\n\nJoin the community on Patreon!: www.patreon.com/fplblackbox      \n\nWe greatly appreciate all SuperChats as a way of supporting the stream! We will do our best to answer these at the end of the stream\n----------------------------------------------\nFollow us:\n\n🅾 INSTAGRAM: www.instagram.com/FPLBlackBox\n\n💻 DISCORD:     / discord  \n\n🐦X: https://www.x.com/fplblackbox\n-----------------------------------------------\n#FPLBlackBox #FPL #FantasyPremierLeague #premierleague #GW1 Fantasy Football Scout, Fantasy Football Tips, Fantasy Football Gameweek 1 GW 1\n-----------------------------------------------\nContact us: \n\n📧 Az@fplblackbox.com\n📧 Andy@fplblackbox.com","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":483,"length":30,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CNYBEM2rARgBIhMI_43ilfarlgMVQAfbAR3GwDXhSOOB5Km9mqCn6wHKAQQIZ7zi","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVE9wUng1dkx0aFQxUkNzUDJvMHg5T3xBR3JiS2FrNXZuU0RjelZQVTJ6MzNIODk4TUFwRDV0Y0kxVEFIaWRTcWttWWRRQURTbkdFM3BqaG9IWEQ2RzFwRDI1Vm1kR3E1ME9MTFJpTTNJN1ZpUXhiZGNmUENURFBUOGVk\u0026q=https%3A%2F%2Fbit.ly%2FFFScoutBlackBox\u0026v=606A09U5AOM","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_UNKNOWN","rootVe":83769}},"urlEndpoint":{"url":"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description\u0026redir_token=QUM4Zm9rVE9wUng1dkx0aFQxUkNzUDJvMHg5T3xBR3JiS2FrNXZuU0RjelZQVTJ6MzNIODk4TUFwRDV0Y0kxVEFIaWRTcWttWWRRQURTbkdFM3BqaG9IWEQ2RzFwRDI1Vm1kR3E1ME9MTFJpTTNJN1ZpUXhiZ